Ein helped Ed see the patterns - the tests want:
- Add items that stack by ID (same item = more quantity!)
- Remove items completely POOF gone!
- Update quantities (zero or negative = bye bye item!)
- Calculate totals with price × quantity math!
- Count ALL the items together!
- Clear everything for fresh start!
- Check if cart is lonely and empty!

Ed didn't add extra stuff! No validation for negative prices! No fancy error returns! The tests didn't ask for that, so Ed says NO EXTRAS!

*pets Ein*

The map uses ID as key so lookups go FAST like the Bebop! Ed used pointers so updates work in place - no copying needed!

